t the hearing the current  director of the fbi he wasn't in charge  during the investigation into nasa i'm  sorry for what you and your families  have been through if allegations raised  by well-known world-class athletes are  not taken seriously by the fbi  what hope do other  victims of sexual assault have  it was clear from their testimony that  these four olympians feel that the  official response to their abuse has not  been sufficient shia britancy al jazeera  capitol hill
 

